<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Will's Brand Canvas</title>
  <meta name="description" content="A private working canvas for Will Nelson's brand strategy." />
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow,noarchive" />
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://mrwillnelson.com/wills-brand" />
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/favicon.png" />
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #f7f7f5;
      --panel: #fbfbfa;
      --ink: #202329;
      --muted: #8b8d90;
      --line: #dedede;
      --blue: #2491ff;
      --green: #13a85a;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    html {
      min-height: 100%;
    }

    body {
      min-height: 100%;
      margin: 0;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--ink);
      font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.28;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      text-rendering: optimizeLegibility;
    }

    .page {
      width: min(100% - 8px, 1240px);
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 2px 0 28px;
    }

    .block {
      background: var(--panel);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .north-star {
      min-height: 224px;
      padding: 56px 38px 34px;
      border-left: 7px solid var(--blue);
    }

    .label {
      margin: 0 0 12px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 21px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      line-height: 1.15;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    h1,
    h2,
    p,
    ul {
      margin: 0;
    }

    h1 {
      max-width: 28ch;
      font-size: clamp(34px, 3.5vw, 43px);
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: -0.035em;
      line-height: 1.08;
    }

    .position {
      margin-top: 18px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: clamp(25px, 2.4vw, 31px);
      font-weight: 400;
      letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    }

    .grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      margin-top: 24px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-left: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .cell {
      min-height: 358px;
      padding: 35px 28px 29px;
      background: var(--panel);
      border-right: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .cell h2,
    .step h2,
    .future h2 {
      color: var(--ink);
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: -0.005em;
      line-height: 1.15;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .cell-title {
      margin-top: 13px;
      color: var(--ink);
      font-size: clamp(28px, 2.45vw, 32px);
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: -0.04em;
      line-height: 1.17;
    }

    .cell-title.narrow {
      max-width: 13ch;
    }

    .cell-copy {
      max-width: 13.5em;
      margin-top: 22px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: clamp(27px, 2.3vw, 31px);
      font-weight: 400;
      letter-spacing: -0.035em;
      line-height: 1.36;
    }

    .cell ul {
      margin-top: 12px;
      padding: 0;
      list-style: none;
    }

    .cell li {
      position: relative;
      padding-left: 27px;
      color: var(--ink);
      font-size: clamp(27px, 2.3vw, 31px);
      font-weight: 400;
      letter-spacing: -0.035em;
      line-height: 1.34;
    }

    .cell li + li {
      margin-top: 12px;
    }

    .cell li::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      top: 0.67em;
      left: 4px;
      width: 5px;
      height: 5px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--blue);
    }

    .funnel {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 62px 1fr 62px 1fr 62px 1.1fr;
      align-items: start;
      min-height: 264px;
      margin-top: 26px;
      padding: 31px 28px 28px;
    }

    .step h2,
    .future h2 {
      text-transform: none;
    }

    .step-copy,
    .future-copy,
    .test-copy {
      margin-top: 15px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: clamp(27px, 2.25vw, 31px);
      font-weight: 400;
      letter-spacing: -0.035em;
      line-height: 1.36;
    }

    .arrow {
      align-self: center;
      justify-self: center;
      color: var(--blue);
      font-size: 32px;
      font-weight: 400;
      line-height: 1;
    }

    .bottom {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 0.48fr 1fr;
      gap: 64px;
      min-height: 226px;
      margin-top: 26px;
      padding: 36px 34px 34px 29px;
      border-left: 7px solid var(--green);
    }

    .future .label,
    .test .label {
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .future-copy,
    .test-copy {
      margin-top: 0;
      color: var(--ink);
      font-size: clamp(27px, 2.3vw, 31px);
      font-weight: 400;
      max-width: 39em;
    }

    .sr-note {
      position: absolute;
      width: 1px;
      height: 1px;
      overflow: hidden;
      clip: rect(0 0 0 0);
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .page {
        width: calc(100% - 20px);
        padding-top: 10px;
      }

      .north-star {
        min-height: auto;
        padding: 32px 24px 28px;
      }

      .grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        margin-top: 18px;
      }

      .cell {
        min-height: auto;
        padding: 28px 24px;
      }

      .cell-copy {
        max-width: none;
      }

      .funnel {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 18px;
        min-height: auto;
        padding: 28px 24px;
      }

      .arrow {
        justify-self: start;
        transform: rotate(90deg);
      }

      .bottom {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 28px;
        min-height: auto;
        padding: 28px 24px;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 520px) {
      .label,
      .cell h2,
      .step h2,
      .future h2 {
        font-size: 14px;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: 36px;
      }

      .position,
      .cell-title,
      .cell-copy,
      .cell li,
      .step-copy,
      .future-copy,
      .test-copy {
        font-size: 26px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="page">
    <section class="block north-star" aria-labelledby="north-star">
      <p class="label">North Star</p>
      <h1 id="north-star">Stories that make customers care and buy.</h1>
      <p class="position">Position: Be worth listening to.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="grid" aria-label="Brand canvas">
      <article class="cell">
        <h2>Who</h2>
        <p class="cell-title">$100M+ high-ACV B2B companies</p>
        <p class="cell-copy">Founders and marketers who need more attention from the right accounts.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="cell">
        <h2>Problem</h2>
        <p class="cell-title">They do not know what will land.</p>
        <p class="cell-copy">They create content without enough signal from the people they need to influence.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="cell">
        <h2>Belief</h2>
        <p class="cell-title">Listen before you create.</p>
        <p class="cell-copy">The best messages already exist in customer, company, and market conversations.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="cell">
        <h2>What We Build</h2>
        <p class="cell-title narrow">Agentic Storytelling Systems</p>
        <p class="cell-copy">Systems that find the story, create the message, distribute it, and learn from buyer response.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="cell">
        <h2>Distribution Engine</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Short-form earns emails.</li>
          <li>X, LinkedIn, and newsletter teach the idea.</li>
          <li>Maven creates conviction.</li>
          <li>YouTube earns enterprise trust.</li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article class="cell">
        <h2>Offers</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Maven: learn the system.</li>
          <li>TalkStories: know what to say.</li>
          <li>64stories: build, manage, and scale it.</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section class="block funnel" aria-label="Distribution path">
      <article class="step">
        <h2>Useful resource</h2>
        <p class="step-copy">Make the first idea useful.</p>
      </article>
      <div class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</div>
      <article class="step">
        <h2>Email</h2>
        <p class="step-copy">Start the relationship.</p>
      </article>
      <div class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</div>
      <article class="step">
        <h2>Maven</h2>
        <p class="step-copy">Teach the method.</p>
      </article>
      <div class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</div>
      <article class="step">
        <h2>TalkStories &rarr;<br />64stories</h2>
        <p class="step-copy">Intelligence, then implementation.</p>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section class="block bottom" aria-label="Future and content test">
      <article class="future">
        <p class="label">Desired Future</p>
        <p class="future-copy">Content helps grow sales without consuming marketing and leadership.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="test">
        <p class="label">Content Test</p>
        <p class="test-copy">Does this help Will crack distribution, teach distribution, or sell a system that creates distribution and demand?</p>
      </article>
    </section>

    <p class="sr-note">Hidden from site navigation. Marked noindex for search engines.</p>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
